  "productivemetalworks.information.upgrade.upgrade_stability.foundry_controller": "停用鑄造爐的流體合金化功能。",
  "productivemetalworks.information.upgrade.upgrade_time.foundry_controller": "加快熔化與合金化的過程。可以安裝多個升級。",
