  "productivemetalworks.message.foundry_formed": "鑄造爐結構已成型",
  "productivemetalworks.message.foundry_invalid": "鑄造爐結構無效。%s",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_building.header": "建造鑄造爐",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_building.text_1": "鑄造爐的最小尺寸為 3x3x2，\n因為結構內部至少需要一格空氣方塊。\n角落方塊並非必要。",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_building.text_2": "鑄造爐的底部必須由加熱線圈組成",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_building.text_3": "此外，鑄造爐必須配備一個鑄造爐控制器...",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_building.text_4": "...一個鑄造爐燃料罐...",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_building.text_5": "...且至少有一個鑄造爐排液口",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_casting.header": "使用鑄造爐澆鑄物品",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_casting.text_1": "要將流體固化成方塊，你需要使用鑄造盆",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_casting.text_2": "對著裝在排液口上的澆注口，點擊右鍵來取出流體",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_casting.text_3": "鑄造盆會慢慢冷卻流體，並將其固化成方塊",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_casting.text_4": "對著鑄造盆點擊右鍵來取出物品。你也可以使用管道或漏斗來自動化輸出。",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_casting.text_5": "你也可以藉由搭配不同的鑄模，透過鑄造桌將流體固化為物品",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_casting.text_6": "手持鑄模，對著鑄造桌點擊右鍵即可放入",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_casting.text_7": "此外，你還可以透過將液體，\n澆淋在鑄造桌或鑄造盆中的物品上，\n來製作「全新」的物品",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_fueling.header": "為鑄造爐提供燃料",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_fueling.text_1": "為了讓鑄造爐運作，鑄造爐燃料罐內必須裝有燃料",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_fueling.text_2": "你可以手持桶子對燃料罐點擊右鍵，或透過管道供應燃料",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_fueling.text_3": "你可以用電動加熱線圈，取代液體加熱線圈，改用能量作為燃料...",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_fueling.text_4": "...或使用高功率電動加熱線圈，\n藉此產生更高的熱量",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_fueling.text_5": "若你選擇使用電動加熱線圈，則必須將燃料罐更換成電容器",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_fueling.text_6": "你可以透過連接線纜，來為電容器供應能量",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_smelting.header": "使用鑄造爐熔煉物品",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_smelting.text_1": "若要將物品送入鑄造爐，你可以透過控制器介面放入...",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_smelting.text_2": "...或直接將物品丟進鑄造爐內",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_smelting.text_3": "一段時間後，鑄造爐內的物品會熔化成液體",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_smelting.text_4": "若你加入第二種液體，\n部分液體可能會發生合金反應。\n加入穩定升級可以防止這種情況",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_smelting.text_5": "專業提示：你可以手持桶子，對排液口點擊右鍵來手動送入流體",
  "productivemetalworks.ponder.foundry_smelting.text_6": "例如：2/3 的鐵與 1/3 的鎳，\n會結合成不變鋼",
